<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Oct 23 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Oct 23 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED OCTOBER 23</p>
<p> (Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............768,600 up.......900</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...697,000 down...5,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......462,100 down.....900</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....755,758 down.....105</p>
<p> Financial companies.......567,228 up.....1,977</p>
<p> New York business loans....42,425 up.......906</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,175 up.......901</p>
</text>
